Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add the constancy conjecture as the open headline variant

[Mic13, Conjecture 9.3] / [MV17, Conjecture 4.3]: the generation degree of
the group-based model ideal on K_{1,n} does not depend on n. Only eventual
constancy is known. It is not contradicted by the Z/17 counterexample and,
with the computed three-leaf value, would give the bound for Z/4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
